description:
Converts between 24-hour military time (0930, 17:45) and 12-hour AM/PM time, and gives the spoken military reading such as 'zero nine thirty'. The page at redbison.dev/military-time-converter shows both directions side by side.

Returns: Text: '1430 = 2:30 PM ("fourteen thirty")'. structuredContent { military, civilian, spoken }.
Example input: {"time":"1430","direction":"toCivilian"}
